---
description: Conventions for F Prime components (pilot + general)
globs: "**/*.fpp,**/*.fppi,**/*.cpp,**/*.hpp,**/test/ut/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Commands, events, telemetry, and parameters are declared in FPP (`.fpp` / `.fppi`), never only in C++.
- Each requirement gets at least one unit test that names its REQ ID in a comment.
- Use the generated test harness macros (`ASSERT_EVENTS_*`, `ASSERT_TLM_*`, command helpers) to check behavior.
- Prefer neighboring component style over inventing new patterns.
- Do not edit autocoded `*Ac.hpp` / `*Ac.cpp` or anything under `build-fprime-*`; change the model and regenerate.
- For the pilot ticket (`TICKET.md` / `REQUIREMENTS.md`): REQ-HM-001 command/param, REQ-HM-002 threshold telemetry, REQ-HM-003 warning event on exceedance for `Ref::SignalGen`.
